rif;\">+20</div><div class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-1\">Años en el mercado</div></div><div><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-[#CABC6B]\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">2</div><div class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-1\">Líneas Premium</div></div><div><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-[#CABC6B]\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">100%</div><div class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-1\">Producción nacional</div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"flex gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#1B1B1B]/8 hover:border-[#CABC6B]/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#CABC6B]/10 transition-all duration-300 group\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#CABC6B]/10 border border-[#CABC6B]/30 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#CABC6B]/20 transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sprout text-[#CABC6B]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 9.536V7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h1.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4 4 4 0 0 0-4 4c0 2 1 3 1 5a5 5 0 0 1-1 3\"></path><path d=\"M4 9a5 5 0 0 1 8 4 5 5 0 0 1-8-4\"></path><path d=\"M5 21h14\"></path></svg></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#CABC6B]/60 tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">01</span><h3 class=\"text-[#1B1B1B] font-bold text-lg\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Cultivo Propio</h3></div><p class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Tomates y duraznos cultivados en nuestros campos bajo estrictos estándares de calidad, desde la semilla hasta la cosecha.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#1B1B1B]/8 hover:border-[#CABC6B]/4