, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.125);\">🍅</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white border border-[#1B1B1B]/8 overflow-hidden shadow-sm\"><div class=\"h-1 w-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.376), rgb(192, 57, 43));\"></div><div class=\"p-7\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3 block\" style=\"color: rgb(192, 57, 43); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Elaboración y Envasado</span><p class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Nuestras distintas líneas de tomates se realizan en varias etapas de elaboración:</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white mt-0.5\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">1</div><span class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/80 text-sm leading-snug pt-1\">Blanqueado en línea</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white mt-0.5\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">2</div><span class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/80 text-sm leading-snug pt-1\">Triturado</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white mt-0.5\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">3</div><span class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/80 text-sm leading-snug pt-1\">Pelado</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"shrink-0 w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-white mt-0.5\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">4</div><span class=\"text-[#1B1B1B]/80 text-sm leading-snug pt-1\">Pulpeado en línea de tomate (x 5 ton)</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-[#1B1B1B] overflow-hidden shadow-sm\"><div class=\"h-1 w-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.376), rgb(192, 57, 43));\"></div><div class=\"p-7\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3 block\" style=\"color: rgb(192, 57, 43); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Producción de Semimanufacturados y Salsas</span><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">En nuestra planta de elaboración realizamos productos como:</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl\" style=\"background: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.082);\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43);\"></div><span class=\"text-white/80 text-sm\">Tomate triturado</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl\" style=\"background: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.082);\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43);\"></div><span class=\"text-white/80 text-sm\">Puré de tomate</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl\" style=\"background: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.082);\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43);\"></div><span class=\"text-white/80 text-sm\">Pasta de tomate</span></div></div><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed italic\">Presentaciones en latas de 250 g, 1 kg y 4 kg. Se realizan más de 4 variantes de salsas.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center gap-3 mt-10\"><button class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background: rgb(192, 57, 43); transform: scale(1.4);\"></button><button class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background: rgba(27, 27, 27, 0.2); transform: scale(1);\"></button><button class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background: rgba(27, 27, 27, 0.2); transform: scale(1);\"></button></div></div></section><section id=\"certificaciones\" class=\"py-28 bg-[#1B1B1B]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20\"><div><span class=\"inline-block text-[#CABC6B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.35em] uppercase mb-4\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Respaldo oficial</span><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">La calidad no es<br>un diferencial,<br><span class=\"text-gradient-gold\">es un estándar.</span></h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Cada producto que sale de nuestra planta está respaldado por rigurosos controles y sistemas de gestión de calidad e inocuidad certificados.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-6 text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#CABC6B] leading-none\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">FSSC<span class=\"text-xl\">22000</span></div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-2\">Certificación principal</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-6 text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#CABC6B] leading-none\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">3<span class=\"text-xl\">+</span></div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-2\">Certificaciones activas</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-6 text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#CABC6B] leading-none\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">IRAM<span class=\"text-xl\">→</span></div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-2\">Origen del proceso</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-6 text-center\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#CABC6B] leading-none\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">100%<span class=\"text-xl\"></span></div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mt-2\">Trazabilidad por lote</div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-8 hover:border-[#CABC6B]/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-10 right-10 h-px rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(202, 188, 107, 0.314), transparent);\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:items-start\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 lg:w-56 shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"background: rgba(202, 188, 107, 0.082); border: 1px solid rgba(202, 188, 107, 0.19);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 188, 107);\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl leading-none mb-1.5\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">FSSC 22000</h3><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 188, 107); background: rgba(202, 188, 107, 0.094); border: 1px solid rgba(202, 188, 107, 0.208); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Certificación Internacional</span></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block w-px self-stretch bg-white/8\"></div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-base leading-relaxed flex-1\">Contamos con una larga trayectoria en sistemas de gestión certificados. Comenzamos implementando normas nacionales IRAM, lo que marcó un primer paso fundamental en la estandarización y control de nuestros procesos. Con el tiempo, en línea con las exigencias internacionales del sector alimentario, evolucionamos hacia los estándares más amplios y exigentes, adoptando actualmente la certificación FSSC 22000.</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-8 hover:border-[#CABC6B]/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-10 right-10 h-px rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(168, 157, 79, 0.314), transparent);\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:items-start\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 lg:w-56 shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"background: rgba(168, 157, 79, 0.082); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 157, 79, 0.19);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(168, 157, 79);\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl leading-none mb-1.5\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">PAS</h3><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"color: rgb(168, 157, 79); background: rgba(168, 157, 79, 0.094); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 157, 79, 0.208); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Prerrequisitos y Saneamiento</span></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block w-px self-stretch bg-white/8\"></div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-base leading-relaxed flex-1\">Nuestra planta cuenta con rigurosos sistemas de limpieza, control de plagas y mejora continua en mantenimiento e instalaciones. Estas prácticas son fundamentales para garantizar la inocuidad de los productos y el cumplimiento con diferentes normas y sistemas de gestión de calidad.</p></div></div><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#212121] border border-white/8 p-8 hover:border-[#CABC6B]/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-10 right-10 h-px rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.314), transparent);\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:items-start\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 lg:w-56 shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\" style=\"background: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.082); border: 1px solid rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.19);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(192, 57, 43);\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl leading-none mb-1.5\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Kosher</h3><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"color: rgb(192, 57, 43); background: rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.094); border: 1px solid rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.208); font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Certificación Religiosa</span></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block w-px self-stretch bg-white/8\"></div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-base leading-relaxed flex-1\">Nuestros productos cuentan con certificación Kosher, emitida por autoridades rabínicas que auditan ingredientes, procesos y trazabilidad. Esta certificación garantiza que nuestros productos siguen estándares de proceso específicos y se cumple la normativa Kosher para poder ser distribuidos en diferentes mercados.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-[#212121] border border-[#CABC6B]/20 p-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-2xl mb-2\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">¿Necesitás la documentación técnica?</h3><p class=\"text-white/50 text-base\">Certificados, fichas técnicas y análisis de laboratorio disponibles para distribuidores y comercios.</p></div><a href=\"https://wa.me/54?text=Hola%2C%20necesito%20la%20documentaci%C3%B3n%20t%C3%A9cnica%20de%20los%20productos%20Golden%20Harvest%20Silvia.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-[#CABC6B] hover:bg-[#A89D4F] text-[#1B1B1B] font-bold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-[#CABC6B]/20 text-sm\" style=\"font-family: Quicksand, sans-serif;\">Solicitar documentación</a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-[#111111] border-t border-white/5 py-10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center md:items-start\"><span class=\"text-[10px] text-gold/50 font-heading tracking-[0.4em] uppercase\">Golden Harvest S.A.</span><span class=\"text-white/25 text-[11px] font-body mt-0.5\">© 2026 — Todos los derechos reservados</span></div><nav class=\"flex gap-6\" aria-label=\"Links del footer\"><a class=\"text-white/30 hover:text-gold text-[10px] font-heading font-bold tracking-[0.2em] up